; lake_frost_arena.room - Gruta do Guardiao: the Frost Guardian's arena (design 04 section 3.5, GRD-03). Flat floor
; (top row 9) from col 1 to col 38 with eight open rows over cols 4-36; the guardian stands at col 25.
; Open at rows 5-8 both ways: west to lake_ice_caves, east to lake_glacier (WORLD-35). The golem (176 px) is taller than
; an opening (128 px), so it cannot follow Ivo out, and it stops while he is outside its Arena (systems/guardians).

